        "statement": "Lake Forest Police Department may be threatened. Numerous commercial structures may be threatened along US-41 (Skokie Highway) in Highland Park."
      },
      {
        "stage": 11,
        "statement": "Numerous residences are threatened off Half Day Road near Sleepy Hollow Park, near Central Avenue and Beverly Place in Highland Park, and near Highland Park High School. Structures are threatened at Highland Park High School. Half Day Road is threatened in Highland Park."
      },
      {
        "stage": 10.5,
        "statement": "US-41 (Skokie Highway) is threatened near Rockland Road in Lake Bluff."
      },
      {
        "stage": 10,
